  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Introduction"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The three-position rocker switch module is a 1CH input device with three fixed positions: left, center, and right, making it suitable as a state switch in various scenarios that require switching the state of lights, mechanical deformation, and more. For example, it can be used to control lighting states in vehicle models, or to switch between different vehicles in one-to-many remote control systems."
    }
  ],
  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tpc-ic\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-p\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 20px; text-align: center; font-size: 24px;\">Documentation</h2>\n<p class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile pct_downloadContent\" style=\"text-align: center; gap: 40px; display: flex; justify-content: center;\"><!--用户手册--><a href=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/52b81b6c1cb5460da3843d7172d1c39a/Three-Position_Rocker_Switch_Module_with_3Pin_SH1.0_Connector-XA010_User_Manual.zip\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #333333; font-weight: 600; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 20px;\" target=\"_blank\"> <img alt=\"2D\" class=\"download_svg product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/4036/9460/files/2d.svg?v=1715161943\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> <span>User's Manual</span> </a><!--规格参数--><a href=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/64b7e82495874c0eab7b72ed8785744e/Three-Position_Rocker_Switch_Module_with_3Pin_SH1.0_Connector_-_XA010.pdf\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #333333; font-weight: 600; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 20px;\" target=\"_blank\"> <img alt=\"2D\" class=\"download_svg product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/4036/9460/files/2d.svg?v=1715161943\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"